{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男星井柏然因影集《早春晴朗》人氣再度急升，戲中跟女主角孫千CP感滿滿，戲外與女友劉雯的感情動向亦受到關注。</p><p>近日井柏然和劉雯因部分入戲的CP粉引發不少討論，甚至傳出女方為避免受到影響，特地與男友錯開行程調整飛機航班。</p><p>沒想到日前（25日）劉</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:42:06.835288+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:16.915358+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:16.915358+00:00","content_hash":"40965ebd01bba2f384ad13918caf79553254dfdf77336847a762950b33a3f47a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}